    "description": "Trosky Castle — Living Painting\n\nA living medieval painting of Trosky Castle, changing gently with the time of day. Rustic brushwork, drifting clouds and subtle movement bring the landscape to life.\n\nFour atmospheres:\n\n- Morning: soft mist drifting through the valley and fields.\n- Midday: warm daylight, layered clouds and gentle wind.\n- Rainy sunset: an overcast sky, rain in three depth layers, wet stone and warm windows and campfire light.\n- Clear night: stars, cool night tones and softly flickering lights.\n\nFeatures include continuous smoke, animated trees, grass and wheat, four musical themes with smooth transitions, and optional wind, rain and campfire sounds with independent volumes.\n\nThe wallpaper follows your PC’s local clock. Rain runs from 18:30 to 21:30, with clear night from 22:00. These are fixed artistic weather timings.\n\nDesigned for 1920 × 1080. The camera stays still by default; gentle cursor parallax is optional. English settings are organized into collapsible groups.\n\nThis Wallpaper made with GPT ASTRA",
